### 1. GET all inventory items
GET http://localhost:5151/inventory


### 2. GET existing item
GET http://localhost:5151/inventory/1


### 3. GET missing item
GET http://localhost:5151/inventory/999


### 4. POST valid item
POST http://localhost:5151/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Webcam",
  "quantity": 7,
  "price": 95
}


### 5. POST invalid - empty name
POST http://localhost:5151/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "name": "",
  "quantity": 3,
  "price": 50
}


### 6. POST invalid - negative quantity
POST http://localhost:5151/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "name": "USB Hub",
  "quantity": -1,
  "price": 30
}


### 7. POST invalid - negative price
POST http://localhost:5151/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "name": "USB Hub",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": -30
}


### 8. Verify created item
GET http://localhost:5151/inventory/4


### 9. PUT existing item
PUT http://localhost:5151/inventory/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "Updated Monitor",
  "quantity": 8,
  "price": 350
}


### 10. Verify route ID wins
GET http://localhost:5151/inventory/2


